Error [E0202]: parameter `x` requires the write-capability marker `&` at the call site
  --> tests/ui/missing_mut_call.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     touch(x)
    |           ^
 Why: `touch` needs to edit this value with the write-capability marker `&`; passing it without that marker grants only read access
 Fix: write `&x` with the write-capability marker `&` when calling `touch`
